      <section class="kit-section" id="the-ai-proposal-prompt">
        <h2>The AI proposal prompt</h2>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>Paste this into Grok Bot, or into any agent you already use. Then paste the job post. Then edit the draft before you send it.</p>
          <p>This is the prompt I would use now. It is not a prompt I have already used to land clients, and it is not how I produced the results I have published from early 2025.</p>
        </div>

        <figure class="scoreboard">
          <figcaption>
            <p class="result-section-label">The old manual process</p>
            <p>Published results from early 2025, from the older manual and ChatGPT process.</p>
          </figcaption>
          <div class="score-grid">
